{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {"FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001": "}", "FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001": "\\footnote{", "MATH_0001": "$g : Y \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0003": "$g \\circ f$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$g$", "MATH_0006": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-quasi-compact-permanence}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-projective-permanence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8815d2f91fc6e210b74999c6e3449f680d765e507bc6db341a7e951c97ca6c50", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2c647140f6a4469a545b1c77ed787aab3f871abd90b9800023645303ceaa335a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be morphisms of schemes.\nIf <MATH_0003> is quasi-projective and <MATH_0004> is\nquasi-compact<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>This follows if <MATH_0005> is quasi-separated by\nSchemes, Lemma <REF_0001>.<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>,\nthen <MATH_0006> is quasi-projective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:46714bd1002b389a0124b1705f2356fc402b011b63206356321da49cd9479f9e", "unit_id": "tag:0C4N:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01VV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-permanence-finite-type}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-ample-permanence}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5e01e21ab7152b25d39c390a1508ba79a9521732b95648d8ce334871ab82510c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:af53a7cf0219e9a907333473195a54d2ec06d56da825ea5490ce29a0eb0272f3", "source_text": "Observe that <MATH_0001> is of finite type by\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nThus the lemma follows from Lemma <REF_0002>\nand the definitions.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2831f22c87e18890de3ffbbb164ed7039c9f3670b5835175ec491e286e108648", "unit_id": "tag:0C4N:proof"}
